# Doppler secrets for Alte' Budgeting (cloud only — no local CLI / .env)
#
# 1. In Doppler dashboard, create project: alte-budgeting
# 2. Add these secrets to configs: dev, preview, prd
# 3. Doppler → Integrations → Vercel → sync each config:
#      dev     → Vercel Development
#      preview → Vercel Preview
#      prd     → Vercel Production
#
# Required
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
#
# Optional (server-only; never expose to the browser)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
#
# Public site URL (invite links, absolute redirects)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app
#
# ── Teller Development bank sync (≤100 enrollments; not Production/KYB) ──
# Create an app at https://teller.io → Application Settings
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TELLER_APPLICATION_ID=app_xxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TELLER_ENVIRONMENT=development
# TELLER_APPLICATION_ID=app_xxxxxxxx
# PEM cert/key from Teller (escape newlines as \n in Doppler values)
# TELLER_CERTIFICATE=-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\n...\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----
# TELLER_PRIVATE_KEY=-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
# Encrypts stored access tokens (any long random string; preferred over CRON_SECRET)
# TELLER_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=long-random-secret
# Vercel Cron → Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET
# CRON_SECRET=long-random-secret
